<title>BELGIUM: Commission clears Vendex buy of BIS France.</title>
<headline>Commission clears Vendex buy of BIS France.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Friday it had cleared a deal under which Dutch company Vendex International NV acquires control of France's Bis SA.</p>
<p>The Commission said the only geographical overlap in the activities of the two firms was in the French market.</p>
<p>&quot;The combined market share would be less than 20 percent. Therefore the operation will not lead to the creation of a dominant position,&quot; the Commission said in a statement.</p>
<p>Vendex/Bis will be the third largest company in the provision of temporary employment services in France after Manpower and Adecco.</p>
</text>
